## Before you start

List what the reader needs first.

## Step 1

Describe the first step, then show the command.

```bash
pnpm create astro@latest my-site
```

### Install dependencies

Nested headings appear indented in the table of contents.

```bash
cd my-site
pnpm install
```

## Step 2

Describe the second step, then show the code.

```ts
type TypePost = {
  title: string;
  tags: string[];
};

export function byTag(posts: TypePost[], tag: string) {
  return posts.filter((post) => post.tags.includes(tag));
}
```

